---
// Substack card: a tile that lifts on hover, Redaction headline, mono address.
---

<a class="ed ed-tile ed-tile-box substack-card" href="https://railly.substack.com" aria-label="Newsletter on Substack: railly.substack.com">
    <span class="substack-heading">
        <span class="ed-label substack-label">
            <svg width="12" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 28" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M0 0h24v2H0zm0 5h24v2H0zm0 5h24v18l-12-7-12 7z" />
            </svg>
            <span>On Substack</span>
        </span>
        <span class="substack-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </span>
    <span class="substack-title">Notes from the workbench.</span>
    <span class="substack-desc">What I’m building, learning, and figuring out along the way.</span>
    <span class="substack-footer">
        <span class="ed-label">railly.substack.com</span>
        <span class="substack-cta">Read & subscribe <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
    </span>
</a>

<style>
    .substack-card {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--color-foreground);
    }
    .substack-heading,
    .substack-label,
    .substack-footer {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .substack-label {
        justify-content: flex-start;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .substack-arrow {
        color: var(--color-foreground-3);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        transition:
            translate 0.2s ease,
            color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .substack-card:hover .substack-arrow {
        translate: 2px -2px;
        color: var(--color-foreground);
    }
    .substack-title {
        margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.25rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.15;
        letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }
    .substack-desc {
        color: var(--color-foreground-2);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .substack-footer {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        padding-top: 1rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ed-line);
    }
    .substack-cta {
        font-size: 13.5px;
        font-weight: 500;
    }
    .substack-cta span {
        margin-left: 0.25rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .substack-card {
            padding: 1.125rem;
        }
    }
</style>
